// One-shot FSM to trigger a long-running counter to delay the next data
// stage. The FSM searches for the sequence 1101 to start the counter. After
// the counter finishes, the FSM waits for the user to acknowledge the timer
// before looking for the next occurrence of the start sequence.
module TopModule (
    input  clk,
    input  reset,
